     3620       input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output v-size, input-output v-format, input-output dim)  no-error.
     3621       run prnfield-add in this-procedure('bc-on', 'Вкл', '', 6, "+/-":U,
     3622       input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output v-size, input-output v-format, input-output dim)  no-error.
     3623       assign
